1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
为什么叫"肉夹馍"，不叫"馍夹肉"？
Why "meat-in-bun," not "bun-holds-meat"?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,200
西安人给你一个答案
The people of Xi'an have an answer

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,800
白吉馍，铁圈虎背菊花心
The bun: crisp rings, a chrysanthemum heart

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,600
腊汁肉，老汤文火，慢炖到化
Pork braised in aged broth till it melts

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,200
一刀剁碎，热汁灌进馍里
Chopped fine, hot juices soak the bun

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:22,000
因为"馍夹肉"，听着像"没夹肉"
Because "bun-holds-meat" sounds like "no meat"

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,800
所以肉必须在前——嫽扎咧！
So the meat comes first. 嫽扎咧 — perfect!

8
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,000
关注，带你去下一座城
Follow — I'll take you to the next city
